== 2. A row of only a spacer, in a column
VStack(spacing: 0) a|HStack{Spacer}|b [30x10]	column=30x2@0,0	a=1x1@14.49,0	row=30x0@0,1	b=1x1@14.49,1
VStack a|HStack{Spacer}|b [30x10]	column=30x2.67@0,0	a=1x1@14.49,0	row=30x0@0,1.33	b=1x1@14.49,1.67
VStack(spacing: 0) a|b [30x10]	column=1x2@0,0	a=1x1@0,0	b=1x1@0,1
HStack{Spacer}	zero 0.65x0 ideal 0.65x0 big 1000x0
HStack{Spacer(minLength: 0)}	zero 0x0 ideal 0x0 big 1000x0
HStackLayout{Spacer}	zero 0.65x0 ideal 0.65x0 big 1000x0
== 3. A spacer in a ZStack
ZStack{x|Spacer}	zero 0x0 ideal 1x1 big 1x1
ZStack{x|Spacer(minLength: 6 cells)}	zero 0x0 ideal 1x1 big 1x1
ZStack{x}	zero 0x0 ideal 1x1 big 1x1
ZStack{Spacer}	zero 0.65x0.33 ideal 0.65x0.33 big 1000x1000
ZStack{Spacer(minLength: 6 cells)}	zero 6x3 ideal 6x3 big 1000x1000
ZStack{Spacer|Spacer(minLength: 6 cells)}	zero 6x3 ideal 6x3 big 1000x1000
ZStack{Color.clear 0x0|Spacer}	zero 0x0 ideal 0x0 big 0x0
ZStack{Color.red|Spacer(minLength: 6 cells)}	zero 2x1 ideal 2x1 big 2x1
HStack{ZStack{x|Spacer}|y} [20x3]	row=2.67x1@0,0	zstack=1x1@0,0	x=1x1@0,0	y=1x1@1.66,0
VStack{ZStack{x|Spacer}|y} [20x6]	column=1x2@0,0	zstack=1x1@0,0	x=1x1@0,0	y=1x1@0,1
== 4. Spacer(minLength:) across its stack's axis
HStack{a|Spacer(minLength: 3 lines)|b}	zero 5.82x0 ideal 8x1 big 1000x1
HStackLayout{a|Spacer(minLength: 3 lines)|b}	zero 5.82x0 ideal 8x1 big 1000x1
AnyLayout(HStackLayout){a|Spacer(minLength: 3 lines)|b}	zero 5.82x0 ideal 8x1 big 1000x1
VStack{ab|Spacer(minLength: 10 cells)}	zero 0x5 ideal 2x6 big 2x1000
VStackLayout{ab|Spacer(minLength: 10 cells)}	zero 0x5 ideal 2x6 big 2x1000
Spacer(minLength: 3 lines) alone	zero 5.82x3 ideal 5.82x3 big 1000x1000
HStack{VStack{ab|Spacer(min 10 cells)}|Spacer|R} [40x3]	column=2x6@0,0	R=1x1@39,2.58
